Why GPL-3.0-or-later:
The streaming engine in console/link-fork/ is a derivative work of drakmor/ampr_emu,
which is licensed GPL-3.0. A derivative of GPL-3 code must itself be GPL-3, so the
whole tool is released under GPL-3.0-or-later. See CREDITS.md for every dependency
and the license-review checklist that must be completed BEFORE any public release.

Before publishing this repository, vendor the verbatim GNU GPL v3 text as a file
named COPYING at the repository root (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt).
